        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://www.culture-pub.jp/hikarukawa/",
          "overview": "In 1958, as a deadly typhoon approaches, a young boy embarks on a perilous journey to a haunted mountain pool, determined to calm a sorrowful spirit whose grief has cursed the village with devastating floods.",
